> []Every Sunday all children (babies through 6th grade) experience safe, age-appropriate environments where the Bible is taught in a creative and relevant way.[ We are so passionate about] kids learning about Jesus in a way they can understand that we create custom age groups for them where they can learn that their story matters!
[We would love to see you and] your family[ visit.] Join the fun and experience a world where kids meet Jesus on their level!
[We] create a safe, clean, and[ welcoming] environment to help your baby know they are[ loved] and cared for.[ We] work very[ hard] to develop trust with you and your baby[ so] you can enjoy the morning service knowing your little one is receiving personal loving care in a safe place!
