Power Up is for kids kindergarten through 5th grade and is located on our 2nd floor.[ Our volunteers] help kids take their next steps toward Jesus in a fun and engaging environment. In our large group gathering, kids sing, dance and listen to incredible, age-appropriate Bible stories. In our small group settings, kids begin building lasting friendships and leaders help them apply the Bible Story to kids’ everyday life through fun activities and meaningful discussions.
